+spacing S2 | 24/24 | 12 sizes x 1 state (setup), light | rendered | 1440x900 setup 카드→시작 버튼 check 24 / observed 24
+spacing S3 | 256/256 | 12 sizes x 5 states, light | rendered | 1440x900 candidates 말풍선 위 여백 check 20 / observed 20
+spacing S4 | 158/158 | 12 sizes x 5 states, light | rendered | 1280x720 setup 선택 줄 사이 check 12 / observed 12
+spacing S5 | 348/348 | 12 sizes x 5 states, light | rendered | 1440x900 candidates 고르기↔되돌리기 check 12 / observed 12
+side: scroll·hud clip·offscreen·top icons | 0 issues | 12 sizes x 5 states, light | rendered | not spot-checked
+before/after (원래 style.css로 같은 검사) | 350/879 → 874/874, 곁 검사 7 → 0 | 12 sizes x 5 states, light | rendered | not spot-checked
